              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="calc-out">
              <div class="formula" id="fEq">KV bytes/token = 2 × 32 layers × 8 kv_heads × 128 head_dim × 2 B = 131,072 B
MLA row: 32 layers × (d_c 512 + d_R 64) × 2 B = 36,864 B</div>

              <div class="bar-row">
                <span class="bar-name">MHA<i class="bar-sub">kv = Q</i></span>
                <span class="bar-track"><i class="bar-fill f-mha" id="barMha" style="width:100%"></i></span>
